<h2>4. Links to external websites</h2>
<p>
	The Website contains links to the professional LinkedIn profile of attorney Hinkov and to the Microsoft
	Bookings booking page. When you follow them, the cookie and privacy policies of LinkedIn Corporation and
	Microsoft apply, over which the controller has no control.
</p>

<h2>5. How to manage cookies</h2>
<p>You can review, block or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings. Instructions for the most common browsers:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Google Chrome: Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies</li>
	<li>Mozilla Firefox: Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
	<li>Safari: Preferences → Privacy</li>
	<li>Microsoft Edge: Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
</ul>
<p>Blocking strictly necessary cookies (if any are added) may limit certain features of the Website.</p>

